    "text": {
     "en": "(additional, not in the textbook) First aid is the help we give right away when someone is hurt.\nFor a small cut, wash it with clean water and cover it with a clean bandage.\nIf you have a fever, rest, drink water and tell an adult. See a doctor if needed.\nDo not take medicines without a doctor's advice."
    }
